WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.502 --> 00:00:04.803
♪ IT SEEMS TODAY
THAT ALL YOU SEE ♪

2
00:00:04.872 --> 00:00:08.207
♪ IS VIOLENCE IN MOVIES
AND SEX ON T.V. ♪

3
00:00:08.275 --> 00:00:11.677
♪ BUT WHERE ARE THOSE GOOD.
OLD-FASHIONED VALUES ♪

4
00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:14.813
♪ ON WHICH WE USED TO RELY? ♪

5
00:00:14.882 --> 00:00:18.017
♪ LUCKY THERE'S A FAMILY GUY ♪

6
00:00:18.085 --> 00:00:21.453
♪ LUCKY THERE'S A MAN WHO'LL
POSITIVELY TELL YOU ♪

7
00:00:21.522 --> 00:00:23.116
♪ ALL THE THINGS
THAT MAKE US ♪

8
00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:24.706
♪ LAUGH 'N' CRY ♪

9
00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:29.761
♪ HE'S A FAMILY GUY ♪

10
00:00:34.251 --> 00:00:35.262
I'M... I'M IN
A RUT.

11
00:00:35.286 --> 00:00:36.629
NOTHING THRILLS
ME ANYMORE.

12
00:00:36.653 --> 00:00:38.564
I MEAN I... I
CAN'T EVEN THINK
OF A REASON

13
00:00:38.588 --> 00:00:40.033
TO GET OFF THE BED
IN THE MORNING.

14
00:00:40.057 --> 00:00:41.006
REALLY?

15
00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:42.836
YOU WANT TO KNOW HOW
PATHETIC MY LIFE IS?

16
00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:44.470
I'VE SEEN THAT
<i>BEHIND THE MUSIC</i>

17
00:00:44.494 --> 00:00:46.461
WITH LEIF GARRETT
18 TIMES.

18
00:00:48.649 --> 00:00:51.149
<i>HEY. UH. HEY. LEIF.
IT'S BEEN A WHILE.</i>

19
00:00:51.218 --> 00:00:52.584
<i>TOO LONG. MAN.</i>

20
00:00:52.653 --> 00:00:54.931
<i>I'M SO SORRY ABOUT
EVERYTHING. MAN. I'M SO...</i>

21
00:00:54.955 --> 00:00:56.488
<i>YOU READY FOR
A BOMBSHELL?</i>

22
00:00:56.557 --> 00:00:58.023
<i>YOU SAVED MY LIFE
THAT NIGHT.</i>

23
00:00:58.091 --> 00:01:00.070
<i>BUT... BUT I WAS
DRIVING. I...</i>

24
00:01:00.094 --> 00:01:02.094
<i>I WAS ON A ROAD TO
DESTRUCTION. MAN.</i>

25
00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:03.562
<i>THE ACCIDENT MAY
HAVE CRIPPLED ME.</i>

26
00:01:03.597 --> 00:01:04.963
<i>BUT I'M ALIVE.
AREN'T I?</i>

27
00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:07.027
<i>C-CAN WE TURN OFF
THE CAMERAS. DUDE?</i>

28
00:01:07.051 --> 00:01:08.411
IT'S... IT'S
LIKE I'M.

29
00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:10.380
I DON'T KNOW.
TRAPPED IN
MY OWN LIFE.

30
00:01:10.404 --> 00:01:13.505
WELL. BRIAN. YOU MAY BE
TOO INWARDLY FOCUSED.

31
00:01:13.574 --> 00:01:15.740
TRY THINKING ABOUT THE NEEDS
OF OTHERS FOR A CHANGE.

32
00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:17.329
WHY DON'T YOU DO
SOME VOLUNTEER WORK?

33
00:01:17.361 --> 00:01:18.610
OH. THAT MAKES SENSE.

34
00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:19.627
VOLUNTEER WORK.

35
00:01:19.696 --> 00:01:20.912
THANKS. BRUCE.

36
00:01:20.981 --> 00:01:22.947
YOU STILL HAVE
13 MORE MINUTES.

37
00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:24.616
OH. DO I?

38
00:01:24.685 --> 00:01:26.652
HMM.

39
00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:29.165
I. UH. I NOTICE
YOU GOT A NEW
RECEPTIONIST.

40
00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:31.334
HEH. NICE LITTLE
BODY ON HER. HUH?

41
00:01:31.358 --> 00:01:32.591
THAT'S MY DAUGHTER.

42
00:01:34.961 --> 00:01:38.561
WELL. WE COULD
PROBABLY CALL THIS
AN EARLY DAY. HUH?

43
00:01:41.385 --> 00:01:42.684
ATTENTION. EVERYONE.

44
00:01:42.752 --> 00:01:44.712
DUE TO SEVERAL
COMPLAINTS AND 2 DEATHS

45
00:01:44.738 --> 00:01:46.438
RELATED TO WORKER FATIGUE.

46
00:01:46.507 --> 00:01:49.591
I HAVE DECIDED TO THROW A
COMPANY PICNIC THIS SATURDAY.

47
00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:51.910
HEY. DEREK. HOW ARE YOU
GETTING TO THE PICNIC?

48
00:01:51.979 --> 00:01:53.623
I DON'T KNOW. I
DON'T HAVE A RIDE.

49
00:01:53.647 --> 00:01:55.892
HEY. JOHN. YOU
GOT A 2-SEATER.
DON'T YOU?

50
00:01:55.916 --> 00:01:58.784
HEY. DEREK.
M-MAYBE YOU GO
WITH JOHN. HUH? HUH?

51
00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:00.146
FOR THE LAST TIME.

52
00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:01.703
I'M NOT GAY!

53
00:02:01.772 --> 00:02:02.954
THANKS ANYWAY. PETER.

54
00:02:03.023 --> 00:02:04.372
HEY. WE'LL GET HIM.

55
00:02:04.441 --> 00:02:06.086
HERE. RIGHT...
RIGHT THIS WAY.

56
00:02:06.110 --> 00:02:07.509
WATCH YOUR STEP.

57
00:02:09.246 --> 00:02:11.663
OK. THEY'RE
IN THE WOODS.

58
00:02:11.732 --> 00:02:13.765
THE CAMERA
KEEPS ON MOVING.

59
00:02:13.834 --> 00:02:16.335
UH. I THINK THEY'RE
LOOKING FOR SOME
WITCH OR SOMETHING.

60
00:02:16.403 --> 00:02:18.837
I DON'T KNOW.
I WASN'T LISTENING.

61
00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:20.539
NOTHING'S
HAPPENING.

62
00:02:20.607 --> 00:02:22.541
NOTHING'S
HAPPENING.

63
00:02:22.609 --> 00:02:24.008
SOMETHING
ABOUT A MAP.

64
00:02:24.845 --> 00:02:26.978
NOTHING'S
HAPPENING.

65
00:02:27.047 --> 00:02:28.313
IT'S OVER.

66
00:02:28.382 --> 00:02:30.222
A LOT OF PEOPLE
IN THE AUDIENCE
LOOK PISSED.

67
00:02:35.806 --> 00:02:37.416
NOW. REMEMBER.
CHRIS.

68
00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:38.785
WE HAVE TO
WORK TOGETHER.

69
00:02:38.809 --> 00:02:40.119
SO THAT
OUR STEPS...

70
00:02:45.266 --> 00:02:46.815
OH. THIS IS MY
FAVORITE EVENT.

71
00:02:46.884 --> 00:02:48.950
"CATCH THE GREASED
UP DEAF GUY."

72
00:02:49.019 --> 00:02:50.485
GO!

73
00:02:50.553 --> 00:02:52.721
YOU'RE NEVER
GONNA CATCH ME!

74
00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:54.322
YOU'RE
WASTING
YOUR TIME!

75
00:02:54.391 --> 00:02:55.556
FORGET ABOUT IT!

76
00:02:55.625 --> 00:02:57.959
GO DO SOMETHING ELSE!

77
00:02:58.027 --> 00:02:59.577
SEE YOU ALL
NEXT YEAR!

78
00:03:02.666 --> 00:03:03.698
KING ME.

79
00:03:03.767 --> 00:03:06.117
I DON'T WANT
TO PLAY ANYMORE.

80
00:03:06.187 --> 00:03:07.486
THE PAIN.

81
00:03:07.555 --> 00:03:10.021
I CAN'T LIVE
LIKE THIS. BRIAN.

82
00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:12.474
I NEED YOU TO
PULL THE PLUG.

83
00:03:14.328 --> 00:03:16.195
WH... I... I CAN'T.

84
00:03:16.263 --> 00:03:18.880
BE MY ANGEL
AND SET ME FREE.

85
00:03:18.949 --> 00:03:20.098
PLEASE?

86
00:03:28.692 --> 00:03:31.209
OH. MY GOD!
YOU WERE REALLY
GONNA DO IT!

87
00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:32.477
I... BUT... YOU...

88
00:03:32.546 --> 00:03:35.897
NURSE. THIS DOG
IS TRYING TO
KILL ME! NURSE!

89
00:03:35.966 --> 00:03:37.810
YOU ARE TWISTED. LADY!
Y-YOU HEAR ME?

90
00:03:37.834 --> 00:03:39.754
YOU ARE SCREWED
UP IN THE HEAD!

91
00:03:42.405 --> 00:03:44.383
THE WINNER OF
OUR FINAL CONTEST

92
00:03:44.407 --> 00:03:46.319
WILL RECEIVE A
VERY SPECIAL PRIZE.

93
00:03:46.343 --> 00:03:48.259
A WEEK'S
PAID VACATION!

94
00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:50.880
DID YOU HEAR THAT?

95
00:03:50.914 --> 00:03:52.391
OH. GOD. PLEASE.
LET IT BE FARTING.

96
00:03:52.415 --> 00:03:54.009
PLEASE LET IT
BE A FART CONTEST.

97
00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:56.818
THESE ARE
TRANQUILIZER DARTS.

98
00:03:56.886 --> 00:04:00.104
I HAVE ENOUGH HERE TO
TAKE DOWN ROBERT DOWNEY JR.

99
00:04:00.157 --> 00:04:02.018
ROBERT DOWNEY.

100
00:04:02.042 --> 00:04:05.009
YES. WELL.
THE LAST ONE LEFT
STANDING WINS.

101
00:04:05.078 --> 00:04:06.878
LET THE GAME BEGIN!

102
00:04:14.437 --> 00:04:15.687
ALL RIGHT. DAD!

103
00:04:15.756 --> 00:04:16.876
GO. PETER!

104
00:04:18.225 --> 00:04:20.687
LOOK AT HIM!
HE RUNS LIKE
A WELSHMAN.

105
00:04:20.711 --> 00:04:21.871
DOESN'T HE?

106
00:04:21.912 --> 00:04:24.312
DOESN'T HE RUN
LIKE A WELSHMAN?

107
00:04:25.015 --> 00:04:26.047
HEY THERE.
BRIAN.

108
00:04:26.116 --> 00:04:27.116
HI. JOE.

109
00:04:28.085 --> 00:04:29.646
HEY. BONNIE MAKING
CHICKEN MARSALA
TONIGHT?

110
00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:32.320
NO. SHE MADE
THAT 3 NIGHTS AGO.

111
00:04:32.389 --> 00:04:34.022
WOW. THAT'S
SOME NOSE YOU GOT!

112
00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:36.886
YEAH. ONE TIME
IT ALMOST GOT ME
A SPOKESMAN DEAL.

113
00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:37.959
"FOLLOW YOUR NOSE."

114
00:04:38.028 --> 00:04:39.394
"FOLLOW YOUR NOSE."

115
00:04:39.463 --> 00:04:40.662
"FOLLOW YOUR NOSE."

116
00:04:42.366 --> 00:04:44.866
OH. I... I'M SORRY.
NO. TH-THAT WAS GOOD.

117
00:04:44.935 --> 00:04:46.629
I JUST. I... I DIDN'T
THINK YOU WERE GONNA

118
00:04:46.653 --> 00:04:48.581
GO SO CARTOONY
WITH IT.

119
00:04:48.605 --> 00:04:50.071
WELL. HOW... HOW
WOULD YOU READ IT?

120
00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:52.118
OH. I DON'T KNOW.
I WAS THINKING
OF DOING IT.

121
00:04:52.142 --> 00:04:54.220
YOU KNOW.
GOOD. LIKE... LIKE
AN ACTOR.

122
00:04:54.244 --> 00:04:56.723
BUT. YOU KNOW.
Y-YOUR WAY'S
GOOD. TOO.

123
00:04:56.747 --> 00:04:59.864
YOU KNOW. WE COULD
USE A NOSE LIKE THAT
DOWN AT THE PRECINCT.

124
00:04:59.933 --> 00:05:01.133
REALLY?

125
00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:05.782
I GUESS IT'S JUST
DOWN TO YOU
AND ME. PETER.

126
00:05:05.806 --> 00:05:08.390
ONE OF US IS GONNA
WIN THAT PAID VACATION.

127
00:05:08.458 --> 00:05:10.859
I DON'T WANT TO
FEED GRANDMA BACON

128
00:05:10.927 --> 00:05:12.661
WHILE SHE'S
IN THE BATHTUB.

129
00:05:12.729 --> 00:05:15.129
PETER. ARE
YOU OK?

130
00:05:22.155 --> 00:05:24.795
MR. WEED. I THINK
PETER NEEDS
A DOC... OOH.

131
00:05:26.542 --> 00:05:28.554
WE HAVE
A WINNER!

132
00:05:28.578 --> 00:05:31.229
HERE. KITTY. KITTY.
KITTY. KITTY.

133
00:05:35.536 --> 00:05:36.546
NO DRUGS.

134
00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:38.297
SHE'S GOOD.
HE'S CLEAN.

135
00:05:38.321 --> 00:05:40.806
IT LOOKS LIKE
THAT'S IT. EXCEPT FOR
THE FLIGHT CREW.

136
00:05:40.874 --> 00:05:41.874
HEY. HEY. BRIAN.

137
00:05:41.925 --> 00:05:43.408
WHAT'S WITH THE
JOHNNY LAW ROUTINE?

138
00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:45.142
SAY HELLO TO
OUR NEWEST NARC.

139
00:05:45.211 --> 00:05:46.143
HE'S A NATURAL.

140
00:05:46.212 --> 00:05:47.212
OH. YEAH?

141
00:05:47.247 --> 00:05:48.287
HOW GOOD ARE YOU?

142
00:05:49.566 --> 00:05:50.843
YOU'RE BACK
FROM MANILA.

143
00:05:50.867 --> 00:05:52.178
YOU HAD LUMPIA
FOR DINNER.

144
00:05:52.202 --> 00:05:54.869
THEN YOU MADE LOVE
TO 2 FILIPINO WOMEN

145
00:05:54.938 --> 00:05:56.087
AND A MAN.

146
00:05:56.156 --> 00:05:57.856
YOU MEAN 3
FILIPINO WOMEN!

147
00:06:01.511 --> 00:06:03.245
NO!

148
00:06:05.115 --> 00:06:06.955
WAIT A SECOND.
GOT SOMETHING.

149
00:06:15.992 --> 00:06:17.759
THIS COULD BE
THE REAL DEAL. BOYS!

150
00:06:17.828 --> 00:06:18.860
LET'S DO IT!

151
00:06:30.423 --> 00:06:32.223
DON'T MOVE.
DIRT BAG!

152
00:06:33.493 --> 00:06:35.293
AH. IT'S COKE! YES!

153
00:06:35.361 --> 00:06:36.773
ALL RIGHT.
WE'VE GOT HIM!

154
00:06:36.797 --> 00:06:39.592
THIS IS GREAT.
THIS IS THE RUSH
I'VE BEEN LOOKING FOR.

155
00:06:39.616 --> 00:06:40.965
GOOD WORK. BRIAN.

156
00:06:41.034 --> 00:06:42.834
UH. YOU STILL GOT
A LITTLE. UH...

157
00:06:43.971 --> 00:06:45.337
OH. OH. THANKS.

158
00:06:52.062 --> 00:06:54.073
SO. PETER. WHERE
SHALL WE GO FOR
YOUR WEEK OFF?

159
00:06:54.097 --> 00:06:57.482
WELL. I WAS THINKING WE
COULD ALL GO TO PURGATORY.
LIKE WE DID LAST YEAR.

160
00:06:57.551 --> 00:06:58.766
THIS ISN'T BAD.

161
00:06:58.835 --> 00:07:00.045
IT'S NOT
THAT GOOD.

162
00:07:00.069 --> 00:07:02.236
BUT IT'S NOT
THAT BAD.

163
00:07:02.305 --> 00:07:03.382
IT'S SO-SO.

164
00:07:03.406 --> 00:07:04.438
UH. MORE
OR LESS.

165
00:07:05.826 --> 00:07:06.870
HEY. HEY. BRIAN.

166
00:07:06.894 --> 00:07:08.026
IF COPS ARE PIGS.

167
00:07:08.095 --> 00:07:09.944
DOES THAT MAKE
YOU A SNAUSAGE?

168
00:07:11.514 --> 00:07:13.626
CLEVER. PETER.
DID YOU STAY UP ALL
NIGHT WRITING THAT?

169
00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:15.467
I GOT TO BED
AROUND 2:00. 2:30.

170
00:07:15.535 --> 00:07:18.637
DO YOU KNOW WHAT JOE SAID
THE STREET VALUE OF THAT
COCAINE WOULD'VE BEEN?

171
00:07:18.689 --> 00:07:21.400
LET'S SEE.
4 AND A HALF KILOS
UNCUT NICARAGUAN.

172
00:07:21.424 --> 00:07:23.892
UH. $1.7 MILL.
THAT AREA?

173
00:07:24.761 --> 00:07:25.811
UH. YEAH.

174
00:07:25.879 --> 00:07:27.823
THAT'S... THAT'S...
THAT'S RIGHT.

175
00:07:27.847 --> 00:07:29.463
YOU GUYS!
BRIAN'S FAMOUS!

176
00:07:29.532 --> 00:07:30.576
YOU'RE A HERO!

177
00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:31.661
WAY TO GO. PAL!

178
00:07:31.685 --> 00:07:33.262
OH. COME ON.
STOP IT YOU GUYS.

179
00:07:33.286 --> 00:07:34.430
IT'S NOTHING.
REALLY.

180
00:07:35.288 --> 00:07:36.982
OH. LOIS. YOUR
TOAST IS READY.

181
00:07:37.006 --> 00:07:38.390
WOW.

182
00:07:38.458 --> 00:07:39.340
OH. MY.

183
00:07:39.409 --> 00:07:40.670
MEG'S USING A
NEW CONDITIONER.

184
00:07:40.694 --> 00:07:41.860
HE'S RIGHT!

185
00:07:41.929 --> 00:07:43.155
HOW DO YOU LIKE THAT?

186
00:07:43.179 --> 00:07:44.212
THAT'S AMAZING.

187
00:07:44.281 --> 00:07:45.725
AND IT'S TIME
TO CHANGE STEWIE.

188
00:07:45.749 --> 00:07:48.216
THAT'S PREPOSTEROUS.
I HAVEN'T... OH. THERE IT IS.

189
00:07:48.285 --> 00:07:49.650
ALL RIGHT.

190
00:07:52.822 --> 00:07:53.972
STOP THE CAR!

191
00:07:55.025 --> 00:07:56.225
OVER THERE.

192
00:07:58.144 --> 00:07:59.827
EVERYBODY FREEZE!
THIS IS A BUST!

193
00:08:01.364 --> 00:08:03.815
BRIAN. THIS IS A
SUNDAY SCHOOL CLASS.

194
00:08:03.883 --> 00:08:05.800
THE HELL IT IS!

195
00:08:05.869 --> 00:08:08.402
PURE BOGOTA BULLION.
THIS IS A DRUG RING.

196
00:08:08.471 --> 00:08:09.703
BUT THESE ARE JUST KIDS.

197
00:08:09.772 --> 00:08:11.239
OH. YEAH?
WHAT'S YOUR NAME?

198
00:08:11.308 --> 00:08:12.668
RICKY.

199
00:08:12.692 --> 00:08:14.692
THEY'RE NOT KIDS.
THEY'RE MIDGETS!

200
00:08:14.761 --> 00:08:16.895
FILTHY.
DRUG-PEDDLING
MIDGETS!

201
00:08:16.964 --> 00:08:18.724
OH. MY GOD!

202
00:08:18.748 --> 00:08:20.828
LOOK OUT.
BRIAN!

203
00:08:21.151 --> 00:08:22.151
UGH.

204
00:08:27.173 --> 00:08:28.206
OH.

205
00:08:28.258 --> 00:08:29.258
UH.

206
00:08:30.343 --> 00:08:31.343
OOH.

207
00:08:32.679 --> 00:08:33.679
AH.

208
00:08:43.606 --> 00:08:44.872
NICE WORK.
ROOKIE.

209
00:08:44.941 --> 00:08:46.185
YOU'RE A
CREDIT TO
THE FORCE.

210
00:08:46.209 --> 00:08:48.626
ADDITIONAL GENERIC
COP COMPLIMENT. BRIAN.

211
00:08:48.695 --> 00:08:50.873
THANKS. BUT
THE REAL HERO
HERE IS GOD

212
00:08:50.897 --> 00:08:52.937
FOR BLESSING ME
WITH THIS NOSE

213
00:08:52.966 --> 00:08:55.578
AND A FEW OTHER
EQUALLY AMAZING
APPENDAGES.

214
00:08:55.602 --> 00:08:56.602
HUH?

215
00:08:56.669 --> 00:08:58.047
OH!

216
00:08:59.706 --> 00:09:01.856
WELL. I BETTER TAKE
THIS COCAINE DOWN
TO EVIDENCE.

217
00:09:01.924 --> 00:09:03.752
OH. HEY. I'LL...
I'LL DO THAT.

218
00:09:03.776 --> 00:09:05.976
UH. I'LL CATCH UP
WITH YOU GUYS
AT THE PUB.

219
00:09:11.968 --> 00:09:13.162
SO IT'S
SETTLED.

220
00:09:13.186 --> 00:09:15.264
WE'RE TAKING
A CRUISE TO
THE BAHAMAS!

221
00:09:15.288 --> 00:09:17.450
AH. THIS IS GONNA BE GREAT.
CRUISES ARE THE BEST.

222
00:09:17.474 --> 00:09:20.057
AND LOOK. IT SAYS
WE HAVE OUR CHOICE
OF CABINS.

223
00:09:20.126 --> 00:09:21.893
PORT OR STARBOARD.

224
00:09:21.961 --> 00:09:23.227
HO. LISTEN TO ME.

225
00:09:23.296 --> 00:09:24.829
I SOUND LIKE
AN OLD SALT.

226
00:09:29.186 --> 00:09:32.015
YES. THOUGH I MUST
SAY. I'VE ALWAYS
DREAMED OF A LIFE AT SEA.

227
00:09:32.039 --> 00:09:33.988
♪

228
00:09:36.426 --> 00:09:39.177
♪ I'M THE GREATEST CAPTAIN
OF THE QUEEN'S NAVY ♪

229
00:09:39.245 --> 00:09:41.340
♪ AND YOUR RECORD
WILL STAND AS PROOF ♪

230
00:09:41.364 --> 00:09:43.882
♪ BE IT GALLEY OR A FREIGHTER.
I'M AN EXPERT NAVIGATOR ♪

231
00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:46.045
♪ AND YOU'RE ALSO
A WORLD-CLASS POOF ♪

232
00:09:46.069 --> 00:09:48.619
♪ MY MANNER. QUITE EFFETE.
IS MISTAKEN ON THE STREET ♪

233
00:09:48.688 --> 00:09:50.838
♪ FOR A SAILOR WHO
CAN PIROUETTE ON CUE ♪

234
00:09:50.907 --> 00:09:52.618
♪ WELL. DESPITE
YOUR POINT OF VIEW ♪

235
00:09:52.642 --> 00:09:55.610
♪ I CAN THRILL A GIRL OR 2 ♪

236
00:09:55.695 --> 00:09:58.113
♪ BUT I'D RATHER
GET IT ON WITH YOU ♪

237
00:10:04.471 --> 00:10:06.254
SORRY TO BE TARDY
TO THE PARTY.

238
00:10:06.323 --> 00:10:08.134
WOW. BRIAN.
HAVE YOU
LOST WEIGHT?

239
00:10:08.158 --> 00:10:09.801
YOU GOTTA TELL ME
YOUR SECRET.

240
00:10:09.825 --> 00:10:10.825
HERE'S A HINT.

241
00:10:10.877 --> 00:10:13.161
PUT DOWN THE FORK! FACE!

242
00:10:13.963 --> 00:10:15.780
SO HOW WAS YOUR DAY?

243
00:10:15.849 --> 00:10:17.610
MY DAY?
UN-FREAKIN'-BELIEVABLE!

244
00:10:17.634 --> 00:10:19.562
FIRST WE NAILED
THIS BASTARD WHO
HAD THE GALL

245
00:10:19.586 --> 00:10:21.336
TO HIDE HIS STUFF
IN HIS DAUGHTER'S DOLL!

246
00:10:21.405 --> 00:10:23.888
HER DOLL.
FOR GOD'S SAKE!

247
00:10:23.957 --> 00:10:26.169
OH. WHERE'S THE LINE ANYMORE?
WELL. I GOT NEWS FOR YOU.

248
00:10:26.193 --> 00:10:28.609
IT'S... IT'S NOT EVEN ON
THE RADAR SCREEN!

249
00:10:28.678 --> 00:10:31.340
THE DAYS OF
DECENCY AND VIRTUE
ARE GONE. HONEY! BAM!

250
00:10:31.364 --> 00:10:33.942
FREAKIN' EVAPORATED.
LIKE A DINGY.
STINKIN' MUD PUDDLE.

251
00:10:33.966 --> 00:10:36.383
ONE... ONE DAY YOU... YOU
SEE YOUR REFLECTION IN IT.

252
00:10:36.452 --> 00:10:39.403
AND THE NEXT DAY.
IT'S A... IT'S A DAMN OIL SPOT

253
00:10:39.472 --> 00:10:41.917
ON YOUR CRACKED DRIVEWAY.
STARING BACK AT YOU.
MOCKING YOU.

254
00:10:41.941 --> 00:10:43.441
BLAH. BLAH. BLAH!

255
00:10:43.510 --> 00:10:46.021
KNOWING THE PERVERTED
TRUTH THAT ROTS IN THE
PIT OF YOUR SOUL.

256
00:10:46.045 --> 00:10:48.046
THAT'S HOW MY
FREAKIN' DAY WAS.

257
00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:52.294
YOU KNOW WHAT
I HAVEN'T HAD
IN A WHILE?

258
00:10:52.318 --> 00:10:53.918
BIG LEAGUE CHEW.

259
00:10:55.789 --> 00:10:58.568
<i>SO TAKE IT FROM</i>
<i>ME. MCGRIFFIN.</i>
<i>THE DRUG DOG.</i>

260
00:10:58.592 --> 00:11:00.236
<i>IF YOU REALLY
WANT TO GET HIGH.</i>

261
00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:02.827
<i>IT'S AS EASY AS
BEING YOURSELF.</i>

262
00:11:02.895 --> 00:11:05.892
<i>WELL. KIDS.</i>
<i>I'M GONNA PASS</i>
<i>THINGS OFF NOW TO...</i>

263
00:11:05.916 --> 00:11:08.996
<i>GERALD. THE</i>
<i>HAPPY AND ABSTINENT</i>
<i>POLICE CLOWN.</i>

264
00:11:09.452 --> 00:11:10.851
<i>HEY. KIDS!</i>

265
00:11:10.921 --> 00:11:13.721
<i>DO YOU KNOW
WHY I'M HAPPY?</i>

266
00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:16.091
<i>BECAUSE I'M
FREE OF "S"...</i>

267
00:11:16.709 --> 00:11:17.908
<i>"T"...</i>

268
00:11:17.977 --> 00:11:19.561
<i>"D" s!</i>

269
00:11:22.966 --> 00:11:25.060
THAT MCGRIFFIN
GUY WAS SO COOL!

270
00:11:25.084 --> 00:11:26.951
TOTALLY! I'M
NEVER DOING
DRUGS NOW!

271
00:11:27.871 --> 00:11:28.920
AHH!

272
00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:31.255
GOT MILK?

273
00:11:35.762 --> 00:11:37.440
CHRIS. BEFORE YOU
GO ON A CRUISE.

274
00:11:37.464 --> 00:11:38.974
YOU GOTTA BUILD
UP A BASE TAN.

275
00:11:38.998 --> 00:11:41.377
BUT. DAD. I HEARD
THAT IF YOU USE
TANNING BEDS.

276
00:11:41.401 --> 00:11:43.746
YOU CAN GET
SOMETHING CALLED
"MELANOMA."

277
00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:47.205
AW. THAT'S JUST FANCY
TALK FOR "SEXIFIED."
NOW CLIMB IN.

278
00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:56.208
HEY. WHAT KIND OF
TANNING BOOTH
IS THIS?

279
00:11:56.232 --> 00:11:58.166
CAN'T YOU READ?
THOSE AREN'T
TANNING BOOTHS.

280
00:11:58.234 --> 00:12:00.034
THAT WHOLE ROW
IS TIME MACHINES!

281
00:12:00.103 --> 00:12:01.797
AW. CRAP! WHERE
THE HELL IS HE?

282
00:12:01.821 --> 00:12:04.033
<i>HEY. DAD. I'M IN
THE BIBLE DAYS.</i>

283
00:12:04.057 --> 00:12:07.491
<i>AND THERE'S A WHOLE STADIUM
OF PEOPLE CLAPPING FOR ME.</i>

284
00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:09.977
<i>OH. LOOK.
MY VERY OWN LION!</i>

285
00:12:10.046 --> 00:12:11.429
OH. MY GOD!

286
00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:15.032
HUH.

287
00:12:15.102 --> 00:12:16.601
MUST'VE GOT
THE WRONG HAT.

288
00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:20.270
AND NOW. HERE'S
SOMETHING WE HOPE
YOU'LL REALLY LIKE.

289
00:12:26.763 --> 00:12:28.946
WHOA. BRIAN.
THERE'S NO SMOKING
IN THE TERMINAL.

290
00:12:28.999 --> 00:12:31.410
HEY. HEY. THERE'S
WORSE THINGS THAN
NICOTINE. PAL!

291
00:12:31.434 --> 00:12:32.611
AND I'M GONNA
FIND 'EM.

292
00:12:32.635 --> 00:12:33.896
PATIENCE.
LAD.

293
00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:35.865
IT TOOK DEAR
ST. PATRICK
MORE THAN A DAY

294
00:12:35.889 --> 00:12:37.900
TO CLEAR THE
EMERALD ISLE
OF SNAKES.

295
00:12:37.924 --> 00:12:39.902
CAN THE IRISH
CRAP. WILL YOU.
HOROWICZ?

296
00:12:39.926 --> 00:12:41.125
OK.

297
00:12:41.627 --> 00:12:42.627
OPEN IT!

298
00:12:42.695 --> 00:12:44.528
AHH! LET ME
GO! HELP!

299
00:12:44.597 --> 00:12:45.847
HELP!

300
00:12:45.915 --> 00:12:47.659
ALL RIGHT. WHERE'S
THE STASH?

301
00:12:47.683 --> 00:12:50.045
I'LL DO A FREAKIN'
BODY-CAVITY SEARCH.
I SWEAR!

302
00:12:50.069 --> 00:12:50.951
AHH!

303
00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:52.331
SIR.
WE APOLOGIZE.

304
00:12:53.573 --> 00:12:55.217
GRIFFIN. THERE'S
NO EASY WAY
TO SAY THIS.

305
00:12:55.241 --> 00:12:56.607
I THINK YOU HAVE
A DRUG PROBLEM.

306
00:12:56.676 --> 00:12:57.808
A DRUG PROBLEM?

307
00:12:57.861 --> 00:12:59.622
WHAT'S THIS
REALLY ABOUT?
JEALOUSY?

308
00:12:59.646 --> 00:13:01.407
AM I STEALING
YOUR THUNDER. JOE.
IS THAT IT?

309
00:13:01.431 --> 00:13:03.192
GIVE ME YOUR BADGE.
FINE!

310
00:13:03.216 --> 00:13:04.426
BY THE WAY.
HOROWICZ.

311
00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:06.929
YOU SHOULD
SHOW JOE YOUR
IMPRESSION OF HIM.

312
00:13:06.953 --> 00:13:08.486
OH. W-WELL. I. UH...

313
00:13:08.555 --> 00:13:10.466
IT'S NOT AS GOOD
AS. YOU KNOW.
MY IRISH COP.

314
00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:11.800
IT'S JUST A
LITTLE THING I...

315
00:13:11.824 --> 00:13:13.436
"LOOK AT ME!
I'M JOE!

316
00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:15.438
"MY LEGS DON'T WORK
BUT I MAKE UP FOR IT

317
00:13:15.462 --> 00:13:17.539
"BY HAVING A VERY
STRONG UPPER BODY!"

318
00:13:18.582 --> 00:13:19.864
WELL. I DO
SAY THAT.

319
00:13:23.219 --> 00:13:25.069
OH. <i>THE OLD MAN</i>
<i>AND THE SEA.</i>

320
00:13:25.138 --> 00:13:27.288
I SEE YOU'RE
GETTING IN THE MOOD
FOR OUR CRUISE.

321
00:13:27.357 --> 00:13:29.307
YEAH.
STUPID FISHERMAN.

322
00:13:29.375 --> 00:13:32.093
SITTING OUT THERE IN A BOAT
YAMMERING TO HIMSELF.

323
00:13:32.161 --> 00:13:34.678
HE DOESN'T EVEN
KNOW I'M WATCHING HIM.

324
00:13:36.416 --> 00:13:38.999
AH. SPLENDID.
FIDO MCCOKE-FIEND IS HOME.

325
00:13:39.068 --> 00:13:40.629
EVERYBODY.
THIS IS TINA.

326
00:13:40.653 --> 00:13:41.653
WHAT HAPPENED
TO YOU?

327
00:13:41.704 --> 00:13:43.132
HOW ABOUT A LITTLE
LESS QUESTIONS.

328
00:13:43.156 --> 00:13:44.700
AND A LITTLE MORE
SHUT THE HELL UP?

329
00:13:44.724 --> 00:13:47.025
YOU KNOW. JUST BECAUSE YOU
CAN'T FEEL YOUR TEETH.

330
00:13:47.093 --> 00:13:49.710
DOESN'T MEAN THE GIRL
CAN'T FEEL YOUR INSULTS.

331
00:13:49.779 --> 00:13:52.080
HELLO. I'M
LOIS GRIFFIN.

332
00:13:52.148 --> 00:13:53.747
WELCOME TO
OUR HOME.

333
00:13:53.834 --> 00:13:54.749
SO. WHAT?

334
00:13:54.817 --> 00:13:56.684
SHE'S LIKE YOUR MOM
OR SOMETHING?

335
00:13:59.522 --> 00:14:01.489
TINA. CAN I GET YOU
A WARM WASHCLOTH

336
00:14:01.557 --> 00:14:03.791
TO WIPE THE DRIED BLOOD
FROM UNDER YOUR NOSE?

337
00:14:03.859 --> 00:14:06.411
HERE. BABY. I'LL SHOW
YOU THE CHANNEL LOIS
DOESN'T KNOW ABOUT.

338
00:14:06.479 --> 00:14:08.024
BRIAN. WOULD YOU...
CHRIS. LOOK AWAY!

339
00:14:08.048 --> 00:14:09.258
MEG. TAKE
STEWIE UPSTAIRS!

340
00:14:09.282 --> 00:14:11.043
WAIT! WAIT! THAT
MAN SEEMS TO
HAVE SUFFERED

341
00:14:11.067 --> 00:14:12.761
A RATHER SERIOUS
SNAKEBITE!

342
00:14:12.785 --> 00:14:14.379
BRIAN. WOULD YOU
PLEASE ASK

343
00:14:14.403 --> 00:14:16.504
YOUR NEW FRIEND
TO LEAVE NOW?

344
00:14:16.572 --> 00:14:18.556
OH. SORRY. THINGS
GETTING A LITTLE
TOO REAL

345
00:14:18.624 --> 00:14:19.773
FOR THE STEPFORD
WIFE?

346
00:14:19.842 --> 00:14:21.125
A-AND LOOK
AT YOU TWO.

347
00:14:21.193 --> 00:14:22.677
QUASIMODO
AND LUMPY.

348
00:14:22.745 --> 00:14:24.862
I... I LEAVE MORE
PERSONALITY

349
00:14:24.931 --> 00:14:27.031
IN TIGHTLY COILED
PILES ON THE LAWN.

350
00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:29.133
OH. DO ME!
DO ME NEXT!

351
00:14:29.202 --> 00:14:31.402
COME ON. BABY GIRL.
LET'S GO TO THE PARK.

352
00:14:39.045 --> 00:14:40.839
HEY. DOC.
WHAT THE HELL
ARE YOU DOING HERE?

353
00:14:40.863 --> 00:14:43.414
YOUR FAMILY HAS
SOMETHING THEY'D
LIKE TO SAY TO YOU.

354
00:14:43.483 --> 00:14:45.695
"BRIAN.
I KNOW I DON'T
SPEAK UP MUCH

355
00:14:45.719 --> 00:14:47.597
"AND IT'S... IT'S
REALLY HARD FOR ME

356
00:14:47.621 --> 00:14:49.532
"TO TALK ABOUT
MY FEELINGS. BUT..."

357
00:14:49.556 --> 00:14:52.451
W-WHY DON'T WE START
WITH SOMEONE MORE
INTERESTING? PETER?

358
00:14:53.993 --> 00:14:56.371
"BRIAN. EVER
SINCE YOUR ADDICTION.
YOU'VE BEEN A JERK.

359
00:14:56.395 --> 00:14:59.197
"I MISS THE GOOD OLD DAYS
WHEN YOU WERE MY SIDEKICK."

360
00:14:59.266 --> 00:15:01.649
UH. SO SHE
HATED MY TIE

361
00:15:01.718 --> 00:15:03.045
UNTIL I TOLD HER
IT WAS MADE

362
00:15:03.069 --> 00:15:05.553
OUT OF 100 PERCENT
BUTTAFUOCO FIBER.

363
00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:08.989
YEAH.

364
00:15:09.058 --> 00:15:10.274
UH. YEAH.

365
00:15:10.894 --> 00:15:11.909
YEAH.

366
00:15:13.179 --> 00:15:15.496
HEY. BRIAN. HOW ABOUT
A LITTLE TIE MUSIC?

367
00:15:15.564 --> 00:15:18.549
♪ PETER'S TIE. PETER'S TIE ♪

368
00:15:18.618 --> 00:15:21.869
♪ THAT'S BECAUSE
PETER'S THE GUY ♪

369
00:15:21.938 --> 00:15:24.555
ALL RIGHT. THAT'S IT.
A LITTLE TIE MUSIC.

370
00:15:26.259 --> 00:15:27.574
HE-HEE.

371
00:15:28.043 --> 00:15:29.844
YEAH!

372
00:15:29.912 --> 00:15:32.046
LOOK. YOU... YOU
GUYS GOT IT ALL WRONG.

373
00:15:32.114 --> 00:15:33.380
I... I... I...

374
00:15:34.884 --> 00:15:36.951
I'M SO SORRY. EVERYONE!

375
00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:40.004
OH. GOD.
I NEED HELP!

376
00:15:40.073 --> 00:15:43.041
WELL. I GUESS NOW WE KNOW
WHAT KIND OF DOG HE IS.

377
00:15:43.109 --> 00:15:44.509
A MELAN-COLLIE.

378
00:15:46.812 --> 00:15:48.128
NOTHING?

379
00:15:48.197 --> 00:15:50.392
W-W-WAIT. NO.
I... I SHOULD'VE SAID...
I SHOULD'VE SAID

380
00:15:50.416 --> 00:15:51.782
"CHI-WAH-WAH."

381
00:15:55.371 --> 00:15:57.605
I DON'T HAVE
TO... IMPRESS YOU.

382
00:15:58.674 --> 00:16:00.419
LOOK. I... I'M NOT
INSENSITIVE. LOIS.

383
00:16:00.443 --> 00:16:02.638
BUT I JUST DON'T
SEE WHY WE GOTTA
CANCEL OUR CRUISE

384
00:16:02.662 --> 00:16:04.339
JUST BECAUSE THE
DOG'S A COKEHEAD.

385
00:16:04.363 --> 00:16:07.198
WE'RE NOT GOING ON VACATION
WHILE BRIAN'S IN REHAB.

386
00:16:07.267 --> 00:16:09.044
WE'LL JUST HAVE TO
WAIT TILL NEXT YEAR.

387
00:16:09.068 --> 00:16:10.734
AW. MAN!

388
00:16:10.803 --> 00:16:13.199
LOOK. I'LL MAKE IT UP
TO YOU. I HAVE A COUSIN
WHO WORKS AT CLUB MED.

389
00:16:13.223 --> 00:16:15.056
♪ ME MIND ON FIRE ♪

390
00:16:15.124 --> 00:16:17.642
♪ ME SOUL ON FIRE.
FEELING HOT. HOT. HOT ♪

391
00:16:18.377 --> 00:16:19.309
HOLY CRAP!

392
00:16:19.378 --> 00:16:21.161
LOOK AT THIS PLACE.

393
00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:22.808
THIS IS WHERE
GOD WOULD COME

394
00:16:22.832 --> 00:16:24.693
IF HE HAD TO
STOP DOING BLOW.

395
00:16:24.717 --> 00:16:25.877
THEY HAVE
TENNIS COURTS!

396
00:16:25.901 --> 00:16:27.017
AND A FULL SPA!

397
00:16:27.086 --> 00:16:30.071
WOW! NO WONDER
PEOPLE DO DRUGS!

398
00:16:30.139 --> 00:16:31.316
GOOD LUCK.
BRIAN.

399
00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:32.952
I JUST KNOW
YOU'RE GONNA
GET CLEAN.

400
00:16:32.976 --> 00:16:35.009
HECK. SHOULDN'T
BE TOO HARD
TO GET CLEAN

401
00:16:35.078 --> 00:16:37.444
WITH ALL THESE
MINERAL BATHS
AND JACUZZIS.

402
00:16:38.881 --> 00:16:40.198
OH. I SEE.

403
00:16:40.266 --> 00:16:42.628
THE FAT MAN MAKES
A PUN. AND EVERYONE
WETS THEMSELVES.

404
00:16:42.652 --> 00:16:45.102
I GIVE YOU GOLD.
AND I GET SQUAT.

405
00:16:45.171 --> 00:16:46.420
I'LL BE IN THE CAR.

406
00:16:48.123 --> 00:16:50.619
THAT WAS A VERY
PRODUCTIVE
FIRST DAY. BRIAN.

407
00:16:50.643 --> 00:16:53.556
OUR GOAL HERE
IS TO FIND
YOUR X-FACTOR.

408
00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:56.859
THE ELEMENT IN YOUR LIFE
THAT MADE YOU TURN TO DRUGS
IN THE FIRST PLACE..

409
00:16:56.883 --> 00:16:58.694
WELL. JUST...
JUST HAVING
SOME TIME AWAY

410
00:16:58.718 --> 00:17:00.529
TO SORT THINGS
OUT IS GONNA
DO WONDERS.

411
00:17:00.553 --> 00:17:01.853
THANKS. DOCTOR.

412
00:17:03.056 --> 00:17:05.156
WH... WHAT ARE
YOU DOING HERE?

413
00:17:05.224 --> 00:17:06.318
I'M ON
VACATION!

414
00:17:06.342 --> 00:17:09.742
OH. AND IF
ANYONE ASKS.
I'M ALSO ON SMACK.

415
00:17:13.415 --> 00:17:15.427
PETER. THIS... THIS
IS A DETOX CLINIC.

416
00:17:15.451 --> 00:17:16.862
YOU CAN'T
VACATION HERE.

417
00:17:16.886 --> 00:17:19.486
WHY NOT?
THIS PLACE IS WAY
BETTER THAN A CRUISE.

418
00:17:19.555 --> 00:17:20.699
Y-YOU SHOULD'VE
SEEN IT.

419
00:17:20.723 --> 00:17:23.040
I WHIPPED A SPEED FREAK'S
ASS AT HORSESHOES TODAY.

420
00:17:23.109 --> 00:17:24.637
PETER. THIS ISN'T
A VACATION FOR ME.

421
00:17:24.661 --> 00:17:26.505
FOR GOD'S SAKE.
I'M TRYING
TO GET HEALTHY!

422
00:17:26.529 --> 00:17:28.129
YEAH. OK. OK.
ALL RIGHT.

423
00:17:28.198 --> 00:17:29.998
HEY. HEY. SOFTBALL
THIS AFTERNOON.

424
00:17:30.033 --> 00:17:31.732
A BUNCH OF US ADDICTS
ARE TAKING ON

425
00:17:31.801 --> 00:17:34.201
THE PREGNANT
TEENAGERS FROM
ACROSS THE LAKE.

426
00:17:34.504 --> 00:17:35.848
OK. COME ON.
EVERYONE.

427
00:17:35.872 --> 00:17:38.551
EXERCISE IS
AN IMPORTANT PART
OF RECOVERY.

428
00:17:38.575 --> 00:17:40.519
JUST WORK WITH
THE RESISTANCE
OF THE WATER.

429
00:17:40.543 --> 00:17:41.754
10 MORE
REPS.

430
00:17:41.778 --> 00:17:44.929
OK. AND ONE.
AND 2. AND 3...

431
00:17:48.017 --> 00:17:50.918
YEAH! I'M ALSO
ADDICTED TO BOOBIES!

432
00:17:56.910 --> 00:17:58.976
I'LL TRADE
YOU THIS FOR
YOUR CUPCAKE.

433
00:18:04.383 --> 00:18:07.129
WHAT? IT WAS
JUST CARPET FRESH.
I'M ON YOUR SIDE.

434
00:18:07.153 --> 00:18:08.786
I'VE BEEN
OBSERVING
YOUR BEHAVIOR.

435
00:18:08.854 --> 00:18:10.721
AND I DON'T THINK
YOU'RE AN ADDICT.

436
00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:12.123
I THINK YOU'RE
AN IDIOT.

437
00:18:12.192 --> 00:18:14.503
WELL. I DON'T
PAY YOU TO THINK.
HOT LIPS.

438
00:18:14.527 --> 00:18:16.838
IN FACT. I DON'T
PAY YOU AT ALL.

439
00:18:16.862 --> 00:18:17.907
COUNT IT!

440
00:18:17.931 --> 00:18:19.763
I'LL BE KEEPING
MY EYE ON YOU.

441
00:18:19.832 --> 00:18:21.015
WHAT'S YOUR NAME?

442
00:18:21.084 --> 00:18:22.567
UH. M-MY NAME?

443
00:18:22.635 --> 00:18:24.285
UH. UH...

444
00:18:24.353 --> 00:18:25.686
UH. UH...

445
00:18:25.755 --> 00:18:26.837
"PEA"

446
00:18:26.906 --> 00:18:29.073
UH. UH. UH...

447
00:18:30.609 --> 00:18:31.875
"TEAR"

448
00:18:31.944 --> 00:18:34.094
UH. UH...

449
00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:35.896
"GRIFFIN."

450
00:18:35.964 --> 00:18:37.859
YEAH. YEAH.
PETER GRIFFIN.

451
00:18:37.883 --> 00:18:39.043
OH. CRAP.

452
00:18:40.536 --> 00:18:42.036
HEY. BRIAN.
I WAS LOOKING
FOR YOU.

453
00:18:42.105 --> 00:18:45.084
HEY. YOU WANT TO GO
MESS WITH THE PREGNANT
TEENS ACROSS THE LAKE?

454
00:18:45.108 --> 00:18:47.108
I... I CAN'T. GROUP
THERAPY. 2:00.

455
00:18:47.176 --> 00:18:48.953
OH. MAN. I PEEKED
IN ON ONE OF THOSE.

456
00:18:48.977 --> 00:18:50.488
IT WAS MORE BORING
THAN WHEN I WAS

457
00:18:50.512 --> 00:18:52.752
A SECURITY GUARD
FOR GEORGE HARRISON.

458
00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:55.750
♪ CHARLES IN CHARGE ♪

459
00:18:55.818 --> 00:18:59.153
♪ OF OUR DAYS
AND OUR NIGHTS ♪

460
00:19:01.323 --> 00:19:02.957
♪ CHARLES IN CHARGE ♪

461
00:19:03.026 --> 00:19:06.994
♪ OF OUR WRONGS
AND OUR RIGHTS ♪

462
00:19:07.063 --> 00:19:10.497
♪ AND I SAY. I WANT
CHARLES IN CHARGE ♪

463
00:19:10.567 --> 00:19:13.546
HEY! HEY! HEY!
QUIET DOWN.
UP THERE!

464
00:19:14.771 --> 00:19:16.187
YOU WACKY BEATLE.

465
00:19:16.256 --> 00:19:18.839
WELL. I... I HAVE BEEN
MAKING A LOT OF
PROGRESS LATELY.

466
00:19:18.908 --> 00:19:21.408
I GUESS MISSING ONE
SESSION WOULDN'T BE
THE END OF THE WORLD.

467
00:19:21.477 --> 00:19:22.793
THERE YOU GO!

468
00:19:22.862 --> 00:19:25.257
HEY. WHAT DO YOU THINK
THEY PUT IN THE BUG JUICE?

469
00:19:25.281 --> 00:19:26.213
BUGS.

470
00:19:26.282 --> 00:19:27.459
NO. THEY DON'T!

471
00:19:27.483 --> 00:19:28.749
COME ON!

472
00:19:29.352 --> 00:19:30.651
SHUT UP!

473
00:19:52.558 --> 00:19:54.292
WELL. I HOPE
YOU'RE PROUD
OF YOURSELVES.

474
00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:56.077
14 PREMATURE BIRTHS!

475
00:19:56.145 --> 00:19:58.145
SORRY. DOC. I...
I DON'T USUALLY
LET PETER

476
00:19:58.214 --> 00:19:59.730
TALK ME INTO THIS
KIND OF STUFF.

477
00:19:59.799 --> 00:20:01.699
WAIT A MINUTE.
BRIAN. YOU HAVE
A PRE-EXISTING

478
00:20:01.767 --> 00:20:03.383
RELATIONSHIP WITH
THIS DEGENERATE?

479
00:20:03.452 --> 00:20:04.947
A DEGENERATE.
AM I?

480
00:20:04.971 --> 00:20:07.332
WELL. YOU ARE
A FASTIZIO.

481
00:20:07.356 --> 00:20:08.434
SEE?

482
00:20:08.458 --> 00:20:10.436
I CAN MAKE UP WORDS.
TOO. SISTER.

483
00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:12.359
WELL. I THINK
WE FOUND
YOUR X-FACTOR.

484
00:20:12.428 --> 00:20:13.639
WHAT? DO YOU
MEAN PETER?

485
00:20:13.663 --> 00:20:16.647
HIS BEHAVIOR IS CLEARLY
A NEGATIVE INFLUENCE ON YOU.

486
00:20:16.715 --> 00:20:19.099
AND WITH YOUR
INTELLIGENCE AND
SENSITIVITY. OBVIOUSLY...

487
00:20:19.168 --> 00:20:22.147
WHOA. HEY!
I MADE MY OWN
MISTAKES. ALL RIGHT?

488
00:20:22.171 --> 00:20:23.649
THIS MAN TOOK ME
INTO HIS HOME.

489
00:20:23.673 --> 00:20:25.273
A-AND HE TREATED
ME LIKE FAMILY.

490
00:20:25.340 --> 00:20:26.584
HE'S MY
BEST FRIEND.

491
00:20:26.608 --> 00:20:28.275
YES. AND LOOK
WHERE YOU'VE
ENDED UP.

492
00:20:28.343 --> 00:20:31.128
YOU KNOW WHAT?
I THINK MY THERAPY
HERE IS COMPLETE.

493
00:20:31.197 --> 00:20:32.980
I CAME HERE
TO GET CLEAN.
AND I DID.

494
00:20:33.049 --> 00:20:34.348
SO GOOD-BYE.

495
00:20:34.417 --> 00:20:37.684
BRIAN. IT'S MOMENTS
LIKE THIS THAT
MAKE ME SAD

496
00:20:37.753 --> 00:20:40.086
YOU'RE GONNA DIE 50
YEARS BEFORE I DO.

497
00:20:44.560 --> 00:20:46.009
♪ HE WAS ALL COKED UP ♪

498
00:20:46.079 --> 00:20:48.079
♪ AND WE WERE CHOKED UP ♪

499
00:20:48.147 --> 00:20:51.326
♪ BUT NOW WE'RE HAPPY
BRIAN'S HOME.
CHA-CHA-CHA! ♪

500
00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:52.966
I AM SERIOUS. LOIS.

501
00:20:53.035 --> 00:20:54.635
YOU COULD BE
IN SHOW BUSINESS!

502
00:20:55.604 --> 00:20:56.804
HEY. MEG.
18 YET?

503
00:20:56.872 --> 00:20:57.771
NO.

504
00:20:57.840 --> 00:20:58.884
HEY. CHRIS.
HOW ARE YOU?

505
00:20:58.908 --> 00:20:59.951
WELL.
I'M GLAD I...

506
00:20:59.975 --> 00:21:01.441
ALL RIGHT!

507
00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:03.160
BRIAN. I FEEL
A LITTLE GUILTY.

508
00:21:03.228 --> 00:21:05.996
IF IT WASN'T FOR ME.
YOU WOULDN'T HAVE BEEN
EXPOSED TO THAT JUNK.

509
00:21:06.065 --> 00:21:08.911
HEY. JOE. IF I'VE
LEARNED ANYTHING FROM
MY EXPERIENCE.

510
00:21:08.935 --> 00:21:12.486
IT'S THAT WE'RE
ALL RESPONSIBLE
FOR OUR OWN DESTINY.

511
00:21:12.555 --> 00:21:14.566
AND THAT'S WHY
I'M LEAVING.

512
00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:15.706
LEAVING?

513
00:21:15.774 --> 00:21:16.873
YOU CAN'T LEAVE.

514
00:21:16.942 --> 00:21:18.959
I HAVE TO. PETER.
FOR ME.

515
00:21:19.612 --> 00:21:21.195
I LOVE YOU ALL.

516
00:21:21.264 --> 00:21:22.697
AW.

517
00:21:22.765 --> 00:21:25.125
SOMEBODY
SAY SOMETHING.

518
00:21:25.902 --> 00:21:27.301
BRIAN. WAIT!

519
00:21:29.906 --> 00:21:31.826
H-HOLD ON
A SECOND.

520
00:21:36.429 --> 00:21:38.028
AIRPORT. PLEASE.

521
00:21:45.188 --> 00:21:47.221
♪
